:"source.wiki.李丽华"}],"tags":["电影"]},{"id":"person.ouyang-shafei","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"欧阳莎菲"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1924","end":"2010","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"苏州"},"coord":[120.62,31.3]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"江苏吴县人，本名钱舜英。演员，代表作《天字第一号》，1968 年获金马奖最佳女配角。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.欧阳莎菲"}],"tags":["电影"]},{"id":"person.kong-decheng","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"孔德成","en":"Kong Decheng"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"孔达生"},{"zh-Hans":"孔玉如"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1920","end":"2008","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"曲阜"},"coord":[116.98,35.6]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"孔子第七十七代嫡孙，字玉如，号达生。1920 年 2 月 23 日生于曲阜孔府，出生百日由大总统徐世昌袭封衍圣公，是末代衍圣公；1935 年国民政府改封「大成至圣先师奉祀官」，他又成了首任奉祀官。抗战起离开曲阜，1949 年赴台，在台北复建家庙，2008 年卒，葬台北三峡龙泉公墓——是继孔端友之后第二位未葬孔林的衍圣公。 "},"visits":[{"kind":"site","name":{"zh-Hans":"曲阜孔庙、孔府、孔林（三孔）"},"address":{"zh-Hans":"山东省济宁市曲阜市 孔庙（城中央南门内）／孔府（孔庙东侧）／孔林（城北约 1.5 公里）"},"note":{"zh-Hans":"第一批国保（1961 年），1994 年 12 月列入《世界遗产名录》。孔庙前后九进、占地 14 万平方米；孔府本名衍圣公府，明洪武十年建独立府第，楼堂厅房 480 余间，前衙后宅——孔德成 1920 年就出生在这座府里；孔林是孔子与后裔的家族墓地，墓 10 万余座，孔尚任墓也在其中。三处相距不远，一天走得完，建议先庙、再府、后林。"},"status":"extant","since":"1370","sources":[{"ref":"source.web.三孔"},{"ref":"source.web.孔德成"}]}],"relations":[{"type":"member_of","target":"institution.kong-fu","role":{"zh-Hans":"第七十七代衍圣公、首任奉祀官"}}],"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.孔德成"}],"tags":["孔子后裔","衍圣公","曲阜"]},{"id":"person.zhang-ailing","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"张爱玲","en":"Eileen Chang"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"张煐"},{"zh-Hans":"梁京"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1920","end":"1995","precision":"day"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"上海"},"coord":[121.47,31.23]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"祖籍河北丰润、生于上海，小说家、散文家。1943–1945 年间在上海文坛成名，写上海与香港的市民生活；1952 年迁居香港，后赴美国。1960 年代经夏志清等重新发掘，成为华语世界最受推崇的作家之一。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.張愛玲"}],"tags":["文学","上海","小说"],"relations":[{"type":"member_of","target":"group.minguo-xuezhe"}]},{"id":"person.cui-lantian","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"崔兰田"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1926","end":"2003","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"曹县"},"coord":[115.55,34.83]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"山东曹县人。豫剧五大名旦之一，创「崔派」，擅演悲剧。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.崔兰田"}],"tags":["戏曲"]},{"id":"person.ma-jinfeng","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"马金凤"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1922","end":"2022","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"曹县"},"coord":[115.55,34.83]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"山东曹县人。豫剧五大名旦之一，绰号「盖九州」，代表作《穆桂英挂帅》。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.马金凤"}],"tags":["戏曲"]},{"id":"person.yan-lipin","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"阎立品"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1921","end":"1996","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"封丘"},"coord":[114.42,35.04]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"河南封丘人，本名阎桂荣。豫剧五大名旦之一，以闺门旦著称。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.阎立品"}],"tags":["戏曲"]},{"id":"person.sang-zhenjun","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"桑振君"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1929","end":"2004","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"开封"},"coord":[114.31,34.8]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"河南开封人。豫剧五大名旦之一，创「桑派」，兼擅戏曲教育。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.桑振君"}],"tags":["戏曲"]},{"id":"person.tang-xicheng","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"唐喜成"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1924","end":"1993","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"尉氏"},"coord":[114.19,34.41]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"河南尉氏人。豫剧生角演员，以「二本腔」假声演唱著称，世称「唐派」。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.唐喜成"}],"tags":["戏曲"]},{"id":"person.chang-xiangyu","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"常香玉"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1923","end":"2004","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"巩县"},"coord":[112.98,34.75]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"河南巩县人，原名张妙玲。豫剧表演艺术家，创「常派」，代表作《花木兰》；曾以义演捐飞机。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.常香玉"}],"tags":["戏曲"]},{"id":"person.zhang-xiuyun","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"张岫云"},"time":{"kind":"interval",